From 0691c5d1d7e3347b52272733cd00a4eba7fd61d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Chandler <admin@lodle.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:19:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] SourceSharp: public SDK headers for a managed game DLL

Engine-interface headers under src/public (networkvar.h, datamap.h,
dt_send.h, dt_recv.h, the iclient*/iserver* entity interfaces, gametrace.h,
toolframework/itoolentity.h, tier1/utlblockmemory.h, ...): declarations and
hooks the SourceSharp host needs, and fixes so the headers compile under
clang 22. Without this, upstream fails in tier1/utlblockmemory.h
("non-const reference cannot bind to bit-field").
---
 src/public/client_class.h              |  8 +--
 src/public/datamap.h                   | 28 ++++++--
 src/public/dt_recv.h                   | 16 ++++-
 src/public/dt_send.h                   | 16 ++++-
 src/public/eiface.h                    |  7 +-
 src/public/gametrace.h                 | 14 ++--
 src/public/haptics/haptic_utils.h      |  6 +-
